Imagine you could have a piece of space right in your pocket and have access to the most accurate information and most precise knowledge about the Moon and its influence on all spheres of life.

This application is designed to help you find simple answers to complicated questions. If you find inspiration and beauty in the sky above, our application is the right one for you as we are working tirelessly to offer you the best experience.

MoonX is free to download and use for everyone. The free version grants you access to the following content:
-Personal Lunar Challenge Program based on 12-houses. Discover your personal life area to rock;
-Complete Moon Calendar with short characteristics of the days;
-Moon Phases and Lunar Days, Actual Moon phase, Moon sign and age;
-Void of Course Moon periods and astrologers’ advice on how to make the best use of this time;
-Affirmations selected in accordance with the Moon energy;
-Your Birthday Moon: information about the Moon on your birthday and how it influenced your personality;
-Birth Chart: the location of the 12 planets during your birthday in houses and zodiac signs;
-Zodiac compatibility;
-Daily inspiring phrases upon opening the application;
-Daily Gratitude journal;
-The option to make personal notes and plan affairs in accordance with the Moon phases;
-Moon appearance for any date;
-Moon and Sun Rise and Set time;
-Customized Notifications of upcoming Moon phases, lunar events and Wiccan Holidays;
-Various Widgets with Moon Data;
-Real-time Moon data;
-Moon Compass pointing at the Moon;
-Live Moon;
-Alarm and Lulling feature with the library of melodies.

We offer MoonX subscriptions that unlock ALL app content and features:

-Tips for 7 spheres of your life (business, relationship, health, beauty and care, food, gardening, general day characteristic);
-Lifestyle calendar with visual highlights;
-Period tracker. Track menstrual cycles aligning them with moon phases;
-Moon Guide. This guide can be helpful as a reminder of what you can focus on during each phase of the lunar cycle. Comprehensive and usable information as to how to align and action to the Moon phases;
-Collections of authors’ Audio Meditations and articles on the Moon Energy, astrology and well-being.
-Rituals prepared in accordance with the energy of each lunar day;
-Video exercises: Surya Namaskar, Chandra Namaskar, etc.;
-Lunar exercises to work on the body parts influenced by the Moon in a particular zodiac sign;
-Natal Chart: the description of the 12 planets during your birthday and their influence on your character and destiny;
-Horoscopes for today, tomorrow, yesterday, month, year;
-Zodiac compatibility: overall, love and sex, relationship potential, friendship;
-Tarot cards reading;
-News about New Moon, Full Moon and other important events from modern astrologers;
-News about wiccan holidays;

Apple Health Integrations: MoonX uses HealthKit to export your MoonX activities to the Health app and to read menstrual cycle data.

Have we missed something? Please take a moment to rate the App and write a review. We read all comments and use them to make improvements for you.

